0:{"buildId":"iNWCfX8KG4iu7ETtWBmLh","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Fix Ad and Landing Page Mismatch to Stop Wasting Paid Traffic\",\"description\":\"Message match failure can make paid clicks feel disconnected from the landing page. Inspect the handoff and test a focused H1 correction before redesigning.\",\"author\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#founder\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-07-25\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-07-25\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/#organization\"},\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/learning-centre/ad-says-one-thing-page-says-another\"},\"image\":\"https://nebulacomponents.com/opengraph-image\"}"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-24","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/learning-centre","className":"text-sm text-accent hover:underline","children":"← Learning Centre"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-4 inline-block rounded-full border border-accent/40 bg-accent/10 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-accent","children":"Message Match"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-fg sm:text-4xl","children":"Fix Ad and Landing Page Mismatch to Stop Wasting Paid Traffic"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Your ad clicks are coming in. Your page looks polished. But conversions are flat. In most cases the culprit is not your offer, your design, or your targeting - it is a silent break in the thread between what your ad promises and what your page delivers."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=learning-centre-ad-says-one-thing-page-says-another&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mt-6 rounded-md border border-border bg-bg-panel p-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-xl font-semibold text-fg","children":"What Message Match Actually Is"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":"Message match is not keyword repetition. It is not simply making sure the word in your ad headline appears somewhere on your landing page. That misunderstanding leads marketers to optimise the wrong thing - sprinkling copy triggers across the page while the visitor still feels a jarring discontinuity the moment they arrive."}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-fg-muted","children":["Real message match is ",["$","strong",null,{"className":"text-fg","children":"emotional and contextual continuity"}],". When a visitor clicks your ad, they carry a mental model with them: a specific expectation of tone, an emotional state shaped by the ad, and an implicit promise about what they are about to see. Message match means your page receives that visitor where they are - not where you wish they were."]}],"$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La"]}]]}],null,"$Lb"]}],"isPartial":"$@c","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$Le","isPartial":"$@f","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L10","isPartial":"$@11","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":"$12"},{"rsc":"$L13","isPartial":"$@14","staleTime":"$d","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@15","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@16"}
